A||||3||Standard||Washed and waxed the GT today..||||14||
Z||000000||Standard||03-23-2000||11:59 PM||||Got home after running a few errands and decided it was so nice out that I just had to shine up the car.  Around 60 here in MN.. shorts and sandals weather!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  Of course, it was sunny when I started.. but as soon got most of the car waxed what else do I feel but a raindrop!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif">  that's ok, tho.  My mom wasn't home yet so I just pulled into the garage.  hehehe.  and that's where it's staying the night.  it's supposed to be raining all day tomorrow, tho.  grrrrr.. i spent about 4-5 hours waxing that thing.  ah well... nothing like spending quality time with the GT!!  later, everyone!||||reg||14
Z||000001||GT Bastard||03-24-2000||12:32 AM||||I spend about 2 hours washing and waxing my truck, and then took it on a 600 miles journey.  Too bad I drove through 2 severe rain storms!  Oh well.... Got any more pictures of your car?  ||||reg||1
Z||000002||Standard||03-24-2000||01:46 AM||||No pics.  I need to get a digital camera.. it was dark by the time I was finished and the GT was tucked inside the garage anyways.  I'm gonna snap some shots tommorow.  hopefully it'll be nice, and not rain all day like they said it would.  ||||reg||1
Z||000003||Standard||03-27-2000||05:04 PM||||Of course it rained all day friday... my car is already pretty dirty.  Also took a 120 mile round trip to visit some friends, tho.  On the way back I just got a sudden urge to break 100mph.. freeway was pretty empty so I just hit the go pedal.  I touched 100 but then a yukon pulled into my lane a little ways up to pass some car.. so I didn't get to  break 100.  oh well, some other time..||||reg||6
